    <string name="guide_title">User Guide &amp; App Instructions</string>
    <string name="guide_subtitle">How to Use the App</string>
    <string name="guide_step_1_title">1. How to Make a Fake Call</string>
    <string name="guide_step_1_desc">Choose your favorite football star from the list, pick a template style (WA, IG, or TG), select Voice or Video Call, set the timer (Call Now or Delay), then tap \'Start Fake Call Simulation\'.</string>

    <string name="guide_step_2_title">2. How to Add a Custom Star</string>
    <string name="guide_step_2_desc">Tap the \'Add Custom (+)\' card at the end of the player list. Watch a short video ad to unlock this feature. Enter player name, select a profile photo, and pick an MP4 video file from your phone gallery.</string>

    <string name="guide_step_3_title">3. How to Drag the Front Camera</string>
    <string name="guide_step_3_desc">When the video call is connected, touch and drag your front camera preview window anywhere on the screen freely.</string>

    <string name="guide_step_4_title">4. How to Set Wallpapers</string>
    <string name="guide_step_4_desc">Open the Wallpaper tab, select your preferred photo or video, then tap \'Set As Wallpaper\' to apply to Home Screen, Lock Screen, or Both.</string>

